{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/teXmpkTsa19CmBC2hw-WXg?click_id=91","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:53.237254+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/teXmpkTsa19CmBC2hw-WXg?click_id=91","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>研招报名通知</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海科技大学物质科学与技术学院自即日起启动2026级硕士研究生推免招生报名活动，并计划于9月下旬进行推免面试。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  1 学校及学院简介  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>物质科学与技术学院（简称物质学院）围绕材料、能源、环境、健康等领域进行科研部署，通过物理、材料、化学、生物等学科的发展和交叉融合，针对物质的创制、组成、结构、表征、性质、性能及其应用进行研究，旨在解决国家长远发展所面临的核心科学和技术问题。上海科技大学牵头或参与建设硬X射线自由电子激光、软X射线自由电子激光、上海光源二期等大科学装置，打造世界领先的、有全球影响力的光子科学中心，构建最前沿的物质科学表征手段。上海科技大学与南方科技大学共建科技部量子功能材料全国重点实验室。物质学院基于卓越的师资力量和先进的科研设施，打造世界一流的教学和科研环境，培养新一代创新型、复合型人才。</span></span></p><p><span><span>物质学院招收3个专业的学术型硕士研究生（全日制）：</span><span><strong><span><span>物理学、化学、材料科学与工程</span></span></strong></span><span>；1个专业的专业型硕士研究生（全日制）：</span><span><strong><span>材料与化工</span></strong></span><span>。欢迎全国各高校</span><span><strong><span>物理学、化学、材料科学、生物科学（含工程、技术）、光电、能源、化工、高分子、药学、环境和冶金</span></strong></span><span>等相关专业</span><span><strong><span>具有推免资格的2026届优秀本科生</span></strong></span><span>报名参加（已通过我院2025年预推免面试的学生，如报考专业、学位类型等无变更意向，无须重复参加此次活动）！</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YXVGEeiaQfiaD3czkGTXIbanrW3E7A1ibCib6DlkV3V7sKbPJKx2C7Kap15WMSHuNM3HSzdXwk8wVAvmyQMlYP7yLQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  2 申请条件  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1、国内各高校物理学、化学、材料科学、生物科学（含工程、技术）、光电、能源、化工、高分子、药学、环境和冶金等相关专业2026届具有推免资格的优秀本科生</span></span></p><p><span><span>2、对科学研究有浓厚兴趣，有志于前沿领域科研工作，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3、诚实守信，学风端正，品德良好，无学业学术不端记录。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  3 申请方式  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>登录上海科技大学研究生招生报名评分系统，按要求如实填写各项信息，完成网上报名。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>报名网址：</span></span><span><span>上海科技大学研究生招生报名评分系统（</span></span><span><span>https://gadmission.shanghaitech.edu.cn/enroll_student/login）——物质科学与技术学院——2026年入学物质学院硕士研究生推免</span></span><span><span>报名。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>截止日期</span><span><span>：即日起至2025年9月18日（含）</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YXVGEeiaQfiaD3czkGTXIbanrW3E7A1ibCiblGWvchfIC2VQ2U2PRzfPkxYY1HrQtYMvU4cPcPcqm6pF1bw8gvIVcg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>上海科技大学研究生招生报名评分系统入口</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  4 上传申请材料  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.必须提供资料，包含：</span></span></p><p><span><span>(1) 个人简历（中英文）</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 有效身份证件（正反面）</span></span></p><p><span><span>(3) 本科成绩单（教务处或院系盖章）</span></span></p><p><span><span>(4) 英语四六级成绩单等英语成绩证明</span></span></p><p><span><span> (5) 学生证（照片、学号页）</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.自愿提供资料：</span></span></p><p><span><span>(1) 本科授课老师（含毕设）或辅导员推荐信，推荐人签名</span></span></p><p><span><span>(2) 各类获奖证书、已发表的论文、专利等学术成果的署名页</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>以上资料按照上述顺序合并成一份PDF文件，文件名务必按照以下格式：学生姓名+本科学校名称.pdf，上传至报名系统。</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  5 面试  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></se