section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>  7 信息获取  </span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1、关注上海科技大学——物质学院官方网站，获取全方位信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://spst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YXVGEeiaQfiaD3czkGTXIbanrW3E7A1ibCibVvPCPFpfWVfxDCZDVUplf63qhEpeDxTdxoQhiadgdr1a73gJFaUaqzA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>（1）师资与研究方向介绍详见：</span></p><p><span>https://spst.shanghaitech.edu.cn/2024/1026/c2090a1102040/page.htm</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" refe